  Derived:
    AdspProbe.cpp (eace137cc122c83551c971a0d6335d5c72fa7f1acc754d45221059be263f4e67) -> PianoAdsp.cpp. Kept: the bring-up order and
      every step (survey, SMP2P item, doorbells, AOSS load_state, cmd-db + lcx/lmx votes through RSC TCS 1, DTB then DSP image
      with init_image/mem_setup/segments/auth_and_reset, ready/fatal/handover on SMP2P, GLINK descriptor and FIFOs, the client queue).
      Changed: SM8750 addresses (IPCC 0x406000, RSC drv-2 0x16520000, carveouts 0xb8200000 + 0x5780000 and 0x9ed80000 + 0x80000);
      no interrupts (the IPCC doorbells and the RSC done bit are polled from the DSP thread: the native KC has no armcpu_spi_attach);
      the secure calls through Sm8750Scm instead of its own SMC loop; one firmware source (modem_a, or piano-power-fw=DIR); a console
      line per stage and a status struct instead of the native_adsp_stats arrays; the survey exported for piano-power=1.
    AdspFirmware.c (ced26abf9e7ae3033dceaa1d39ccbf85e73abc636aac41aa7e3d3b2741e67a7c) -> PianoAdspFirmware.c: the headers from
