      NativeUfs's native_ufs_part_find/native_ufs_part_read (package/NativeUfs exports them).
    ShengQrtr.c (d3cac365aa20c5a6dc02ab3f2635ccec2c332cfd1862ec805512935124d440cc) -> PianoQrtr.c: the same domain table and
